<title>USA: Mesaba Airlines May load factor up.</title>
<headline>Mesaba Airlines May load factor up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mesaba Holdings Inc said the May passenger load factor for its Mesaba Airlines rose 3.1 percentage points to 55.5 percent from 52.4 percent a year ago.</p>
<p>Available seat miles in the month rose 32.6 percent to 87.2 million from 65.8 million a year ago. Revenue passenger miles rose 40.3 percent to 48.4 million from 34.5 million.</p>
<p>Mesaba operates as a Northwest Airlink affiliate under a code-sharing agreement with Northwest Airlines Inc.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
